     <P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">8月17日下午，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>在</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>绍兴文理学院河东校区环保执法培训基地一</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>楼</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>报告厅</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>我校数学正高级</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>、特级</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>教师虞</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>金龙</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>受绍兴文理学院培训中心邀请，给柯桥区新入职的教师作了一</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>场</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>题为</FONT>“追求卓越----谈教师的修炼”的主题讲座</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>虞老师以个人成长</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>中的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>丰富教学经历和成功育人经验</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>为主线</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，为</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>受训</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>教师</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>奉上了</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>一场</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>精彩的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(64,64,64); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>讲座</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p> <A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082609195631.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082609195631.png" width=554 height=352> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>虞老师说：</FONT>“每一位教师的成长经历都是一部独特的、无法复制的历史，我们每个人都像浩瀚星河里的星星，都有自己的故事。”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>虞老师介绍了自己从教三十多年的教学经历，主要谈到以下四个方面：一个理想，二个关键，三种境界，四类目标。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>要当好一名老师，虞老师的感悟是首先要热爱教师这个职业，虞老师从小的理想就是当一名光荣的人民教师，因而对教书有热情，而当好一个老师的两个关键是上好课、做好班主任</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>因为教师的职责是教书育人，教书就是要上好课，做好班主任是育人的重要途径</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>在多年的教学中，虞老师觉得一位优秀的教师在对待学生、对待荣誉、对待学校都要有一定的境界，只有这样，才能安心教学</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>就一名高中数学教师而言，虞老师认为可以有以下四类目标：课堂受学生欢迎，班主任学生喜欢，兴趣活动有成效，教科研成果丰硕。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p> <IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082609202095.png"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082609202087.png"></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>一名</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>教师要修炼什么？第一方面就是要</FONT>“读知识</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> ”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>当老师首先要有</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>扎实的专业知识，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>要给学生一杯水，教师要有一桶水</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>。另外，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>要想教好学生，就得放下老师架子，去接近学生、接纳学生，多研究学生，读懂</FONT>“学生”这本书。因此，虞老师认为</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>教师要修炼的第二方面就是要</FONT>“读学生”，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> <FONT face=微软雅黑>要读懂</FONT>“学生”这本书，首先要教好书，教师的职责是教书育人，书要教好，人更要育好。教书，就是要上好课，而当好班主任是教师育人的重要途径。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>那么，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>教师还需要修炼什么呢？虞老师认为第三方面就是要</FONT>“读自己</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> ”。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>法国作家雨果说过：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>世界上最广阔的是海洋，比海洋更广阔的是天空，比天空更广阔的是人的胸怀。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>有了比天空更广阔的胸怀，人才能装得下事，拿得起，撂得下，不斤斤计较，不愤懑牢骚，不悲观忧伤，才能把自己的脑力用在有价值的大事上。要当好一名优秀的教师，虞老师认为必须有三种境界：对待学生要尊重</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>对待荣誉要淡定</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>对待学校要热爱</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> <FONT face=微软雅黑>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>歌德说过：</FONT>“人生至关重要的事是有远大的目标和达到这个目标的雄心壮志”。 人生有了目标才有了奋斗的动力，所以我们要不断给自己制定目标，一步步实现梦想。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>从虞</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>老师</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>踏上教学岗位至今，他觉得教师的最大乐趣就是通过课堂，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>让</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>学生被教学的力量所折服</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>、</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>所倾倒！在课堂上，虞老师给自己的定位是：如果</FONT>“讲课”，就要讲出知识的逻辑性来，讲出知识背后的东西，将自己的认识、自己的困惑、自己的体会讲给学生；不是把知识强加给学生，而是在和学生感受知识带给人们的快乐。考试得高分不是我们唯一的教学目的，让学生真正从内心喜欢思考、喜欢学习，学生的思维具有逻辑性才是我们教师的价值所在！这样的教学才是有意义的教学。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p> <A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082609204013.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202008/2020082609204013.png" width=554 height=297> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>在教学中，虞老师采用</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">“行动研究”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>的方法</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>坚持在教学中研究</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>于研究中教学，做到教学与科研相互促进，并取得了很好的效果。这些年来主编《平面几何》、《解析几何》等数学竞赛教材及教学辅导书，参编浙江省数学作业本等教材配套资料；并出版《教学的感悟》、《教师如何写论文》等个人专著；近</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">60</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>万字数学专业论文分别在《数学通报》、《教学月刊》《中学数学教学参考》等三十多家省级及全国级刊物公开发表。多篇文章被中国人民大学书报资料中心和江苏教育出版社的中学生读物转载</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>并指导学生多人在省级刊物上发表数学论文。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">    </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>讲座最后虞老师把中国近代教育家（也是我们绍兴一中的杰出校友</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">)</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT face=微软雅黑>夏丐尊先生的话作为讲座的结尾：</FONT>“教育不能没有感情，没有爱的教育，就是如同池塘里没有水一样，不称其为池塘，没有情感，没有爱，也就没有教育。” </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>一位新教师听完讲座后加了虞老师的微信，并回复虞教授：</FONT>“长达三个小时的讲座，虞</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><FONT face=微软雅黑>教授给了我们新教师很多思想上、知识上的干货，让我们这群初涉教育岗位的新教师得到了受益终生的知识。</FONT>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)">  </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 微软雅黑; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); COLOR: rgb(25,25,25); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-shading: rgb(255,255,255)"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
